@martincostello Thanks for filling this issue!

The behavior around mapping `DescriptionAttribute` to `schema.description` is handling by the underlying System.Text.Json schema mapper. As part of these APIs moving to production, this default behavior will be removed so we'll have to do the mapping at the OpenAPI-level. We can resolve the issue there.

Gonna bucket this into 9.0 for now. We'll need to do this after STJ's APIs are shipped in the library and we replat on top of them.
